# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Contact form (Web3Forms) — optional
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The contact form posts to Web3Forms so messages land straight in your inbox.
#
# 1. Go to https://web3forms.com and enter the destination address
#    (hugoo.ramirez@outlook.com). No account is required.
# 2. Copy the access key they email you.
# 3. Either paste it into `VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY` below (copy this file to `.env`)
#    or paste it into the `WEB3FORMS_ACCESS_KEY` constant in
#    `src/components/Contact.jsx`.
#
# The key is public by design and safe to ship in client-side code.
# If it is left empty, the form falls back to opening the visitor's mail client.
#
# Note: Vite only exposes variables prefixed with `VITE_`.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
